  "row_count": 21,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 4. 5 7 6 + 1. 7 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 4 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 4. 5 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 8 9 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 4 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4. 5 7 7 \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 1 6 3 3 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 5 3. 1 3 4 + 2. 2 6 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 2 8 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 1 4. 1 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 5 3. 1 3 4 - 2. 2 6 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 2 8 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 7. 0 6 3 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 4 7. 0 3 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 1 6 3 3 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 5 6. 3 8 2 + 4. 5 1 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 7 5 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 5 9. 7 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 5 6. 3 8 2 - 4. 5 1 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 7 5 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 2 9. 8 6 2 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 6 4. 8 9 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Gronvold (47) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 4. 5 7 6 + 1. 7 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 4 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 4. 5 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 8 9 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 4 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4. 5 7 7 \\\\ \\end{array}",
      "$$",
